  "blocks": [
   {
    "id": "p1",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Take a look at the ingredient "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "label",
      "ref": "v-label"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " of just about any food on supermarket shelves. I’m sure you’ll see a few additives. Here are some of the most common food additives. Which of them are harmful to your health, and which of them are mostly safe?"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "h1",
    "type": "heading",
    "level": 3,
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Artificial food dyes"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p2",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Artificial food dyes are used to improve the appearance of various foods."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p3",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "In recent years, more and more studies have found that dyes such as Blue 1, Red 40, and Yellow 5 can cause "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "allergies",
      "zh": "过敏反应"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " in some people. Some researchers have also reported that food dyes can cause "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "hyperactivity",
      "zh": "多动症"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " in children."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p4",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "In addition, in animal studies, Red 3 can cause cancer. It has been largely replaced by Red 40."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "h2",
    "type": "heading",
    "level": 3,
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Artificial sweeteners"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p5",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Common man-made sweeteners include "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "aspartame",
      "zh": "阿斯巴甜"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ", "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "sucralose",
      "zh": "三氯蔗糖"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ", and "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "saccharin",
      "zh": "糖精"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ". They are widely used in food and drink products."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p6",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Studies have shown that artificial sweeteners can help people manage their weight and blood sugar levels. However, some artificial sweeteners, like aspartame, can cause headaches in some people. And in July 2023, the World Health Organization labeled aspartame as a possible cause of cancer in humans."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "h3",
    "type": "heading",
    "level": 3,
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "Guar gum",
      "zh": "瓜尔胶"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p7",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Guar gum is commonly used to thicken foods. You can find it in ice cream, salads, sauces, and soups."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p8",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Since it’s high in "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "fibre",
      "zh": "纤维素"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ", guar gum is generally considered healthy. It can make people feel fuller, leading them to snack less throughout the day. Some scientists have also found that guar gum can help lower people’s blood sugar levels. Just make sure you don’t take in too much of it."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "h4",
    "type": "heading",
    "level": 3,
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "MSG",
      "zh": "味精"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p9",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "MSG stands for monosodium glutamate. It’s used to improve the taste of salty dishes. You can find it in a wide variety of "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "processed",
      "ref": "v-processed"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " foods. Many restaurants and fast-food places also use it."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p10",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "A 1969 study on mice found that taking in large amounts of MSG could damage the "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "nervous system",
      "zh": "神经系统"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ". However, scientists believe the additive has little effect on human brain health."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
